  "title": "VAREX SCHEDULES THIRD QUARTER FISCAL YEAR 2026 EARNINGS RELEASE AND CONFERENCE CALL",
  "summary": "SALT LAKE CITY, July 27, 2026 – Varex Imaging Corporation (Nasdaq: VREX) today announced that it will report unaudited financial results for the third quarter of fiscal year 2026, following the close of regular trading on Monday, August 10, 2026. The earnings news release will be followed by a conference call at 3:00 pm Mountain Time […]",
